{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#card-zh","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 是 DSH Web 侧栏整理插件，在侧栏底部添加全局面板开关和设置页。它可收起面板入口、改用图标网格、调整列数与图标尺寸、设置收起时保留的入口或行数，并自定义面板顺序。折叠状态和偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage；Host 侧将面板点击数写入 DSH home 下的 JSON 文件。适合想为工作区腾出空间并整理侧栏的 DSH Web 用户；需要 DSH Web profile 和 Node.js 20 或更高版本，不需要 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:9-23","src/client.js:395-425","src/client.js:487-531","src/index.js:22-24"]}
{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#card-en","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins organizes the DSH Web sidebar. A footer toggle collapses global panels; settings enable an icon grid, adjust icon size and columns, keep selected entries visible, and set panel order. Preferences use browser localStorage. Requires a DSH Web profile and Node.js 20 or later.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:9-23","src/client.js:395-425","src/client.js:487-531","src/index.js:22-24"]}
