{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#feature-1","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 的功能「收起全局面板」：在侧栏底部提供展开或收起开关；点击后切换工作区上方的全局面板列表，默认收起并记住选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:189-204","src/client.js:534-595"]}
{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#feature-2","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 的功能「网格面板」：在设置 → 内置插件中开启网格模式并选择每行 2–4 个图标；侧栏面板入口显示为图标，名称作为悬停提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:487-531","src/client.js:739-765"]}
{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#feature-3","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 的功能「自定义顺序」：设置页允许逐个选择侧栏面板并上下移动；应用后按所选次序显示，也会将选中的约定式侧栏条目纳入面板列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:354-384","src/client.js:451-475","src/client.js:766-895"]}
{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#feature-4","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 的功能「收起时保留入口」：设置列表模式保留的前 0–5 个入口，或网格模式保留的前 0–3 行；展开后显示全部入口。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:395-425","src/client.js:753-758"]}
{"unit_id":"rivenshanghai__dsh-toomuch-plugins#feature-5","repo":"rivenshanghai/dsh-toomuch-plugins","commit":"335551730d85d8f015f5f7ee02cf3bcd6f6b8915","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-toomuch-plugins 的功能「点击计数」：用户点击侧栏面板入口时，客户端通过 Host 远程服务报告面板 id，Host 累加计数并写入 DSH home 下的 click-counts.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:598-678","src/index.js:22-24","src/index.js:43-70"]}
